{"id":859080,"title":"01｜推理大模型与普通大模型存在哪些差异？","content":"本文对比了推理大模型如DeepSeek R1与普通大模型在实际应用中的差异。首先，定义了推理大模型，其核心特点是输出答案前会展示思考过程（思维链），提升准确性和可解释性。DeepSeek R1通过规则引擎和回溯机制确保推理的可靠性，尤其适用于需要逻辑验证和自我纠错的场景。然而，在简单计算或无需解释的任务中，推理大模型表现不佳，响应时间长且资源消耗高。对于程序员而言，推理大模型适合算法实现、代码优化等复杂任务，而普通大模型则适用于直接生成代码或快速响应需求。访问方式包括对话、API及应用程序，其中API方式需注意计费和内容长度限制。评估模型选择时，应考虑首Token响应时间、总耗时、每秒输出tokens数和总调用tokens数，以平衡运营效率、成本和用户体验。总之，不同场景下选择合适的模型至关重要。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":398528,"user_name":"kevin","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1629537,"ip_address":"江苏","ucode":"8A0F58E2723893","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/18/dd/61/544c2838.jpg","comment_is_top":true,"comment_ctime":1741587159,"is_pvip":true,"replies":[{"id":146409,"content":"课件下载地址在【课程介绍】下方。","user_name":"编辑回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1356014,"ctime":1760008470,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":398528,"utype":2}],"discussion_count":4,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101000501,"comment_content":"有ppt吗？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1356014,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/14/b0/ee/c7b74a14.jpg","nickname":"冬青","note":"","ucode":"14576781B499FB","race_medal":0,"user_type":8,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":672461,"discussion_content":"课件下载地址在【课程介绍】下方。","content_length":48,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1760008470,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":8,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":2017420,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1e/c8/8c/e81c8f83.jpg","nickname":"王智鹏 Zac","note":"","ucode":"FD7504640C833A","race_medal":0,"user_type":8,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nick